# HTML with Preview

```html {title="card.html"}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: sans-serif;
            padding: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        h1 { color: #667eea; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>Hello, Markup+!</h1>
        <p>This HTML is rendered live.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
